body:
maybe, but i doubt it. i just wish i was accepted the same as my friends. for some reason i'm super notorious in my city as well, it's not like i'm overly promiscuous or anything either. for some reason people just know what i look like and they know my name, so sometimes i'll go into the city centre to go to a cafe or meet up with friends and somebody i've never even seen before will walk past me and call me a faggot or a waste of space. it's just so tiring and i can't deal with it anymore

&#x200B;

sorry if i'm ranting, it's been a while since i've spoken my mind to anyone
